    "description": "There’s not a lot of desserts that can beat a delicious cookie that’s easy to bake and easy to make. In this video, learn how to make magic cookie bars using graham cracker crumbs, butter, chocolate chips, coconut, nuts, and condensed milk. Mix the graham cracker with butter before pouring and smoothing it out over the bottom of the pan. Next, pour the milk over the surface and sprinkle in the rest of the ingredients. Press the toppings flat into the pan before putting it into the oven until lightly browned. Finally, cut it into bars and taste the magic! Check out this video to see every step of the magic cookie bar recipe.",
